{"id":13033713206,"name":"Become Forklift Certified Obby!","desc":"Join the Appalling Games group to unlock a FREE Ice Forklift skin!\n\nOperate a forklift to complete the obby. Once you complete all 35 stages, you become forklift certified!\nGo to the settings (gear icon) to toggle DPad controls.\n\nControls:\n• WASD - Move your forklift\n• Q - Lower fork\n• E - Raise fork \n• Double Tap R - Reset character\n\nAdmin commands:\n• /explode [player]\n• /fling [player] [power (optional)]\n• /give [player (optional)] [tool] - tools include btools, sword, and rocket/rocketlauncher\n• /hint [message]\n• /kick [player]\n• /kill [player]\n• /msg [message]\n• /noclip [player (optional)] - Toggles noclip\n• /walk [player]\nPrivate server owners and star creators get admin commands!\n\nPremium players get to use the Premium forklift skin!\nNote: Real forklifts have turning wheels on the back, but it would've made turning much harder in this game.\n\nTags: forklift, obby, obstacle course, parkour, driving, rage, difficult, funny, certified, certification, appalling","path":"/game/13033713206-become-forklift-certified-obby","slug":"13033713206-become-forklift-certified-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0e2f5679d76f6db5f92518cd58a71edd3f65354c4bea49fedb772d65fd0f381e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-56771c0093472ae1286f22a98c52632e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":70,"visitor":79276921,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-17T22:25:58.120Z","creator":{"name":"Appalling Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69b9d4f679ce9602d16612b0","title":"KEYLESS AUTOFARMER","game":{"_id":"69b44bd2ec95ce09d1b7337f","gameId":13033713206,"name":"Become Forklift Certified Obby!","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0e2f5679d76f6db5f92518cd58a71edd3f65354c4bea49fedb772d65fd0f381e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-56771c0093472ae1286f22a98c52632e